		(property "Key Specs" "VIN 4.5-28 V; VOUT 0.6-26 V adjustable; IOUT max 2 A; fixed 500 kHz with spread spectrum; 148 mOhm / 78 mOhm integrated FETs; 5 ms soft start; Eco-mode pulse skip; hiccup overcurrent protection; Tj -40 to 125 C; 3 uA shutdown, 45 uA quiescent"
